<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian producer prices up in May.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian producer prices up in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Economics Ministry released the following data -</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES		 May     April   March</p>
<p>    General index (base=1980)   140.89  139.82  139.18</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    +0.77   +0.46   -0.26</p>
<p>Food, drink, tobacco index  154.84  152.07  150.16</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    +1.82   +1.27    n/a</p>
<p>    Energy index		    101.23  100.12  100.91</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    +1.11   -0.78    n/a</p>
<p>    Index ex oil products	 150.29  149.36  148.35</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    +0.62   +0.68    n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - main increases were for the following products - meat and petroleum products.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
